 The path next to the 
\family typewriter
File
\family default
 command is the path to the file on the system where the installer will
 be created.
 The
\family typewriter
 /r
\family default
 parameter specifies that all files and subdirectories of the folder will
 be copied recursively
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
