key "rolandbaer-nsis-tutorial"

\end_inset

.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The function 
\family typewriter
CreateDirectory
\family default
 creates a new folder by using the path in the quotes.
 
\family typewriter
CreateShortcut
\family default
 creates a new shortcut to the path in the first quotes.
 The second parameter is the path to the destination 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "nsis-docs-chapter4"

\end_inset

.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The command 
\family typewriter
WriteRegStr
\family default
 creates a new entry in the registry.
 File type definitions and file extensions are registered by creating a
 key in 
\family typewriter
HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT
\family default
 (
\family typewriter
HKCR
\family default
).
 The first parameter is the root directory (in our case 
\family typewriter
HKCR
\family default
), the second one defines the subfolder.
 The third parameter defines the name of a key in the subfolder and the
 last one is the value of this key 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
