\begin_layout Subsubsection
BSF4ooRexx Reinstaller NSIS Script 
\begin_inset CommandInset label
LatexCommand label
name "sub:BSF4ooRexx-Reinstall-Script-NSIS"

\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The reinstaller script looks pretty much the same as the installer script.
 The only differences are, that first, the reinstaller saves itself from
 the installation folder to avoid being deleted in the next step.
 Secondly, it starts the uninstall process, which completely removes the
 BSF4ooRexx installation.
 Finally, the reinstaller acts just like the installer and installs BSF4ooRexx
 again.
 Last but not least, it copies itself back to the installation folder, because
 it cannot install itself.
 The necessary changes to produce this reinstaller from the installer script
 are described in this chapter.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The reinstaller doesn’t have an user interface, because in this case it
 is not necessary, so the lines in listing 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
