\begin_layout Standard
Basically, the spec file is a simple text file, which is located in the
 
\family typewriter
SPECS
\family default
 directory of the 
\family typewriter
rpmbuild
\family default
 folder.
 As already mentioned, it defines the packages meta data and the actions
 that will be taken during the build process.
 The user does not have to write the complete file on his or her own from
 the scratch.
 It is possible to create a basic spec file using the command shown in listing
 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
