The install script, which is shown in full length in chapter 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "sub:The-Mac-OS-postflight-script"

\end_inset

 in the Appendix, creates symbolic links to ooRexx and BSF4ooRexx in the
 
\family typewriter
/usr/bin
\family default
 and 
\family typewriter
/usr/lib
\family default
 directories.
 Furthermore it links the ooRexx manual pages to 
\family typewriter
/usr/share/man/man1
\family default
 and adds the C++ header files to
\family typewriter
 /usr/include
\family default
.
 After copying all ooRexx-related files, the ooRexx 
\family typewriter
rxapi
\family default
 daemon is restarted.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Finally, the BSF4ooRexx support for OpenOffice/LibreOffice is installed
 by adding the corresponding 
\family typewriter
JAR
\family default
 files to the 
\family typewriter
CLASSPATH
\family default
 environment variable and copying the ooRexx macros to the OpenOffice/LibreOffic
e's script directory.
 This step will only be executed, if OpenOffice/LibreOffice is installed.
 If, not it is omitted.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Last but no least, the 
\family typewriter
lsregister
\family default
 command is used to refresh all file association settings.
 As a result, all ooRexx and BSF4ooRexx script files are shown with their
 correct file type icons in the Mac OS X finder.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Subsubsection
The Uninstall and Reinstall Scripts 
\begin_inset CommandInset label
LatexCommand label
name "sub:The-Uninstall-and-Reinstall-Scripts-OSX"

\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The uninstall and reinstall process is primarily handled by four different
 scripts.
 All of which can be found in chapter 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "sub:Source-Codes"

\end_inset

 in the Appendix.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Description
uninstall.sh: This script is executed if the user presses the uninstall or
 reinstall item in the ooRexx menu bar.
 It needs a parameter, indicating which process has to be started.
 If the parameter is 
\begin_inset Quotes eld
\end_inset


\family typewriter
reinstall
\family default

\begin_inset Quotes erd
\end_inset

, the currently present ooRexx and BSF4ooRexx installation will be removed
 and newly installed, using the script described in chapter 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "sub:The-Mac-OS-Uninstall-Script-OSX"

\end_inset

 in the Appendix.
 On the other hand, if the parameter is 
\begin_inset Quotes eld
\end_inset


\family typewriter
uninstall
\family default

\begin_inset Quotes erd
\end_inset

, the installation will be removed.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Description
ooRexx_uninstall_preflight.sh: This script removes all symbolic links that
 were created by the installer script from 
\family typewriter
/usr/bin
\family default
, 
\family typewriter
/usr/lib
\family default
, 
\family typewriter
/usr/include
\family default
 and
\begin_inset Newline newline
\end_inset

 
\family typewriter
/usr/share/man/man1
\family default
.
 In addition, it unloads the ooRexx 
\family typewriter
rxapi
\family default
 daemon, removes it and starts 
\family typewriter
BSF4ooRexx_uninstall_preflight.sh
\family default
.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Description
BSF4ooRexx_uninstall_preflight.sh: Like the previous script, it removes the
 created symbolic links from the 
\family typewriter
/usr/bin
\family default
 and 
\family typewriter
/usr/lib
\family default
 directories.
 Furthermore the ooRexx and BSF4ooRexx directories in 
\family typewriter
/opt
\family default
 are removed and the 
\family typewriter
ooRexx.app
\family default
 bundle in 
\family typewriter
/Applications
\family default
 is deleted.
 Finally the 
\family typewriter
CLASSPATH
\family default
 entries in
\family typewriter
 /etc/profile
\family default
 are removed.
\begin_inset Newline newline
\end_inset

If the parameter 
\begin_inset Quotes eld
\end_inset


\family typewriter
uninstall
\family default

\begin_inset Quotes erd
\end_inset

 has previously been set, the uninstall process is finished here.
 Otherwise, the 
\family typewriter
reinstall.sh
\family default
 script gets invoked.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Description
reinstall.sh: This script installs a fresh copy of ooRexx and BSF4ooRexx
 in the 
\family typewriter
/opt
\family default
 directory and 
\family typewriter
ooRexx.app
\family default
 in the 
\family typewriter
/Applications
\family default
 folder.
 Afterwards the install script, described in chapter 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "sub:The-Install-Script-OSX"

\end_inset

, is executed.
 
\end_layout

