\begin_layout Section
Roundup and Outlook
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard

\series bold
Authors: Jürgen Hesse, Manuel Paar 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
After intensive work on the mentioned installers, it can be said that each
 of which has its own advantages and disadvantages.
 The NSIS installer for example, is a very mighty and flexible tool, which
 can be extensively customized.
 On the other hand, it does not have a graphical interface and needs an
 external editor for creating the installation scripts.
 Regarding usability, the creation of installation scripts using NSIS is
 comparable to the creation of Debian- or Red Hat-based packages.
 In contrast to these, Iceberg is primarily using a graphical interface,
 which makes it very comfortable to use on the cost of customisability.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Nevertheless, it can be critically noted, that the work on the installers
 created during this thesis will never be finished completely.
 The reason for this, are the continuous adjustments on the underlaying
 operating systems, e.g.
 changes on registry keys on Windows, which will require permanent maintainance
 of the installers, even if the hardest part of the work is finished.
 This fact is especially true for the Linux packages: On the one hand, there
 are differences between the particular versions of operating systems from
 the same distribution and, on the other hand, there are even larger differences
 between particular distributions that use the same package management system
 (e.g.
 Debian or Ubuntu).
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Personally, we can say that the creation of the Mac OS X installer was the
 biggest challenge for us, due to its characteristics (e.g.
 its special Java implementation or the Application Bundle structure).
 Therefore, we decided to develop this installer together.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Finally, it can be stated, that the ease of installation of BSF4ooRexx on
 the mentioned operating systems using the created installer packages was
 largely improved.
 We hope this helps making BSF4ooRexx more appealing to a larger number
 of users.
\end_layout

